Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:56:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add edit and delete capability for client records

- Edit button on each client row opens the existing form pre-filled
  with the client's current data
- Save updates the existing Supabase row matched by client id
  (no duplicate created, citations/reports/competitors preserved)
- Delete button with confirmation modal warns about cascading removal
- Editable fields: business name, category, address, city, postcode,
  phone, website

https://claude.ai/code/session_0199tT3HEzQi15uzFHhgQb8w
